  "statement": "# Browser simulation snapshot These browser meshes and physics replays were generated by this repository's simulation tools on 2026-10-25–26 and captured for the first public site on 2026-10-28. They are a historical demo, not a validation of the latest CAD or proof of physical hardware performance. Current design reports live alongside their workstreams under `exports/leg`, `exports/body`, and `exports/turret`. The static site and local simulator consume exactly these files. To publish a new simulation, regenerate using `python -m sim.robot_v2` / `tools/simulate.py` with the appropriate reviewed source revision, review the results, and commit this snapshot with the corresponding design change. Never substitute `rl/` training artifacts. Do not distribute licensed vendor source CAD.",
